terjemahan broth3r<i>max</i>

51
00:05:38,382 --> 00:05:41,382
PEDAGANG BARANG

52
00:05:48,304 --> 00:05:50,932
Kau membuat dia
menunggu seperempat jam.

53
00:05:51,933 --> 00:05:53,810
Maafkan aku, pak.

54
00:06:08,449 --> 00:06:10,535
Mohon maaf, Tuan Knock,

55
00:06:10,577 --> 00:06:12,036
