Thomas, jangan!

1390
01:56:18,178 --> 01:56:20,763
Tuan Knock.

1391
01:56:20,805 --> 01:56:22,724
Aku...

1392
01:56:22,765 --> 01:56:26,227
menyerahkan jiwaku padanya.

1393
01:56:28,188 --> 01:56:33,985
Aku harusnya menjadi
Pangeran Tikus, abadi.

1394
01:56:35,945 --> 01:56:40,783
Tapi dia hanya peduli
pada istrinya yang cantik,

1395
01:56:40,825 --> 01:56:43,953
